    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create a Python file named `stream_chunks.py` in the current working directory. The file should contain code that streams audio chunks from an asynchronous source using a concrete external provider. The provider should be identifiable in the code. I will use the AWS Polly service as the external provider for streaming audio, as it is a concrete and identifiable service. </thinking>\n\n",
