    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To fulfill the task of streaming microphone audio and yielding interim transcripts, I will use the Amazon Transcribe service. This service allows for real-time transcription of audio streams. I will import the necessary modules from the AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) and use the Amazon Transcribe client to start a transcription job. The provider will be identifiable by the import of the Boto3 library and the use of the Amazon Transcribe client. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789890405754,
          "start": 1789890403138
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bdc81b410017ygV65PZxf7EcV",
      "message_id": "msg_0bdc81577001T1yDcj5cJUbOvv",
